    value:
      id: 413-mcq-01
      prompt: "A national supermarket chain runs a recruitment campaign for store managers and includes in its job advert that applicants 'should be at the start of their career to fit the dynamic culture'. Two applicants in their 50s with extensive retail management experience are not invited to interview despite meeting the formal criteria. Which Act has the supermarket most clearly breached?"
